  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">for strategic planning, communications, and fund development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The African Center for Equitable Development (ACED) is a think-and-do tank driving equitable development across Africa, with an integrated approach that combines evidence generation and translation, policy engagement and on-the-ground action, to make research and other types of knowledge relevant, accessible and usable to policymakers and practitioners. As ACED is in the process of developing its 2030 strategy, this Organizational Effectiveness (OE) grant will be instrumental in supporting this transition through the update of its strategic framework, communication strategy, and fundraising capacity.</narrative>
  </description>
